model {
  extend basalt.catalog {
    metadata {
      constraint "A site-aware outside service stays one catalog app: credential preflight checks the selected origin under host network policy; its MCP sign-in on the account's selected site asks only for the MCP scope, registers a client only where that site advertises registration, and reaches only that server's tools, each behind approval. Token and own-OAuth methods keep the unchanged REST provider and its saved accounts. Guide links on a provider's site template open on the selected site, and a site chosen in the connect dialog carries across that app's method alternatives. Hosted and local preflight descriptors retain their app identity and run function and pass the dialog's selected site into the actual check request; registered-client state remains on that form."
    }
  }
}
